        "name": "The Baby is Here",
        "steam_appid": 4023030,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive while the promise is broken</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted by the echo of his deceased son, Joseph, a guilt-ridden father, clings to the only penance left: to complete the masterpiece the boy left unfinished. It's not a painting or a poem, but a complex artifact, a marvel of gears and dreams the two of them were meant to build together now you you need to Escape and Survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Search and Build the Artifact Pieces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by the memory of a broken promise from their last conversation, Joseph must embark on a journey to build and find the Artiface Pieces through the places that shaped his son's life. Each component—from a clockwork heart to the wings of memory— unlocks a painful memory and a truth about the genius he never understood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve the mysteries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look around and solve the mysteries and puzzles, and as the artifact takes shape, Joseph will discover that he's not simply building a machine. He's rebuilding, piece by piece, the bond his own words broke, in a desperate search for forgiveness he can no longer ask for. It's a story about how sometimes, to let go of a ghost, we must first learn to build its dream.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive while the promise is broken</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted by the echo of his deceased son, Joseph, a guilt-ridden father, clings to the only penance left: to complete the masterpiece the boy left unfinished. It's not a painting or a poem, but a complex artifact, a marvel of gears and dreams the two of them were meant to build together now you you need to Escape and Survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Search and Build the Artifact Pieces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by the memory of a broken promise from their last conversation, Joseph must embark on a journey to build and find the Artiface Pieces through the places that shaped his son's life. Each component—from a clockwork heart to the wings of memory— unlocks a painful memory and a truth about the genius he never understood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve the mysteries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look around and solve the mysteries and puzzles, and as the artifact takes shape, Joseph will discover that he's not simply building a machine. He's rebuilding, piece by piece, the bond his own words broke, in a desperate search for forgiveness he can no longer ask for. It's a story about how sometimes, to let go of a ghost, we must first learn to build its dream.</p>",
        "short_description": "When everything looked like a tragedy he noticed that everything was broken from the beginning with his son. Help Joseph to complete the masterpiece the boy left unfinished on this Survival Horror Game.",
